  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory-style headlights are identical to the original unit in every way— the same quality and the same method of installation. And every headlight assembly undergoes strict testing before it leaves the factory.\nFitment\n2007-2013 Chevy Silverado 1500 models only\n2007-2014 Chevy Silverado 2500HD/3500HD models only\n(2500HD/3500HD, fit 2007 new body style & 2014 old body style models only)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: headlights assembly compatible with 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 Chevy Silverado 1500, 2007-2014 Silverado 2500 HD, 2007-2014 Chevy Silverado 3500 HD (Not fit 2007 Chevy Silverado Classic); high beam bulb type: HB3/9005; low beam bulb type: H11; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof Design: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter & Safer: Lights minimize obnoxious glare during the night; the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact Resistance: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
